      "function_role": "diatonic-cycle-v-function",
      "narrative": "In the full cycle of 4ths (Ch.8, p.49) 'I IV vii\u00b0 iii vi ii V I,' G7 is the only diatonic dominant 7th. This is the vehicle for practicing all seven diatonic 7th qualities, with G7 as the sole dom7 and structural tension chord before resolution to C\u25b3.",
      "source_principle_ids": [],
