      "narrative": "Greene's key constraint on dom7alt: 'VI7 sounds good with any altered tone when used in smooth connection with the chords that precede or follow it' (Ch.9, p.59). Altered tones are free choices conditioned on smooth melodic movement \u2014 spice without voice-leading disruption.",
